    label: 'Chains supported in production',
    period: 'EVM and beyond',
    note: 'Ethereum, Solana, TON, Bitcoin, Cosmos, Polkadot, Arbitrum, Base, OP Stack, modular rollups. Multichain by default, not by retrofit.',
